    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "to have similar tastes (in food)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "結婚相手とは、性格よりも何より口が合うことが一番大切だと思う。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "私たちは好みの味付けが似ているので、どこへ外食に行っても口が合う。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「これ、美味しいね！」「本当だ、僕たちやっぱり口が合うね」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "兄は佐介の元気を愛して大いに話し口が合う。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "春の潮",
                "author": "伊藤左千夫",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "to be in sync (of lip movements with spoken or sung vocals)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "歌番組の口パク疑惑は、映像と音声の口が合っていないことから浮上した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "腹話術師の人形は、まるで生きているかのように声と口が合っていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "吹き替え版でアクターの口が合っていない。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "to understand each other",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "何度も話し合いを重ねて、ようやく双方の口が合うようになった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "チーム全員の口が合うまで、作戦会議を終わらせるわけにはいかない。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "兄弟でも口が合わないことがある。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
